<div class="home-container">
  <h1>Pomodoro Timer</h1>
  <h3>Our purpose is to provide you with the structure and support to motivate your success.</h3>
  <p>Welcome to the greatest study app in history. You will no longer have to struggle academically, emotionally, and mentally with the help of Pomodoro, an application providing catered, guided, focus sessions for any occasion. </p>
  <div class="menu-options">
    <div class="option-card">
      <h2>Quick Start</h2>
      <p>Begin with default settings</p>
      <%= link_to "Start Timer", timers_start_path(session_time: 25, break_time: 5, color: "red"), class: "button" %>
    </div>

    <div class="option-card">
      <h2>Customize Settings</h2>
      <p>Personalize your timer experience</p>
      <%= link_to "Settings", timers_settings_path, class: "button settings-button" %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="resources">
    <h3>You Deserve To Be Heard And Understood. The NJ Hopeline Offers Sound Advice And A Safe Place To Connect <3 </h3>
    <%= link_to "NJ Hopeline", "https://www.thehopeline.com/", class: "button resource-button", target: "_blank" %>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .home-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .menu-options {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 30px;
    margin: 40px 0;
  }

  .option-card {
    background-color: #f8f8f8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 20px;
    width: 300px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background-color: #4CAF50;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .settings-button {
    background-color: #2196F3;
  }

  .resource-button {
    background-color: #9C27B0;
  }

  .resources {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #f1f1f1;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
</style>
